{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S03、S13等段的到时感受短语比较密集，观众边听边看可能来不及捕捉全部；X的左右分栏在快速浏览感受时更直接。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】把每段最重要的心理转折突出出来，普通观众即使不逐字读完，也比较容易抓住人物当下的想法。更重要的是，它把音乐变化与情绪细节对应起来，也把舍不得、怀念、孤独、动摇、不甘心到重新向前的心理过程交代得更完整。X的左右分栏更利于快速浏览，但部分动机和情绪之间的过渡被压缩了，尤其少了Y对矛盾心理的细致呈现。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "566ab565-c493-4d08-8d9e-8db8aefdf22c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T010031370899Z", "elapsed_seconds": 130.61, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:02:41.997821+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2facbc674aff43dd21a126c4e4b09b48e18d988560cf75b15aa9f59361128075", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedf